          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "The BrainBots have discovered that they are very good conductors of electricity - but what does that mean?! And what’s the difference between a conductor and an insulator? In this episode, Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs will learn all about the importance of electricity, how to be safe around it and even travel on an electric current around a circuit!\n\nBonus Chapter – Try out this experiment all about static electricity with Gibbs!",
